{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1480281-how-many-experience-a-level-5-fightingstyle-merit-cost-in-cofd-2e\uff1f","id":1480281,"title":"How many experience a level 5 fightingstyle merit cost in CofD 2e\uff1f","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-06T05:47:47-07:00","id":1480281,"title":"How many experience a level 5 fightingstyle merit cost in CofD 2e\uff1f","content":"Some old friend tell me it only costs 5 experience, because after all, a merit is a merit. Howevery, recentlly i meet some new friends say they usulally cost 1+2+3+4+5=15 experience to buy a level 5 fighting style merit in CofD 2e.<br /> This is interesting, 15 experience could buy a Clan Discipline to level5 in VtR ! It feels a little expensive for a fighting style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27147-stgreygrey","name":"STgreygrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27147_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T06:55:17-07:00","id":1480285,"title":"","content":"From my reading of 2e, it's a fixed cost of 1 Experience per dot, so five dots would be five Experiences. It seems likely to me that your new friends are more familiar with first edition and or the Old World of Darkness, which did have increasing costs like that for merits, attributes, and the like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T06:56:03-07:00","id":1480286,"title":"","content":"What your new friends described was true in CofD 1e (also known as nWoD). Your old friend is right that in CofD 2e, Merits cost only 1 Experience per Dot. <s>I'm not sure about Discipline costs, but 15 Experiences are not enough to but all Five Dots in either edition.</s>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":7593,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","user":"Teatime","date":". 05-06-2022, 12:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T07:15:31-07:00","id":1480287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1480281-how-many-experience-a-level-5-fightingstyle-merit-cost-in-cofd-2e\uff1f?p=1480286#post1480286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure about Discipline costs, but 15 Experiences are not enough to but all Five Dots in either edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is in 2e, In-Clan Disciplines are 3 Experiences a dot. 3*5=15 Experiences to buy level 5, although unless you're making a new character raising more than one point every few months will likely cause you to get whacked with a rulebook. Yes, this has the delightful result that kindred don't raise Strength or Stamina before maxing out Vigor or Resilience. I prefer to see this as a feature.<br /> <br /> But yes merits cost one Experience per dot, no matter how highly rated. Find a quirk in some rulebook that allows you to buy eight dots of Wealth and it still would only cost 1XP every time you raised it.<br /> <br /> I'm AFB, but I believe there might be an exception for power stats? I think some double in cost for dots 6-10.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T07:44:53-07:00","id":1480288,"title":"","content":"Every book I've read, Wyrd/Lair/Blood Potency/etc (all the power stats) cost 5 xp per dot, no matter their rating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12103-vintervalpen","name":"Vintervalpen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T08:03:21-07:00","id":1480290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwoDSix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1480281-how-many-experience-a-level-5-fightingstyle-merit-cost-in-cofd-2e\uff1f?p=1480287#post1480287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm AFB, but I believe there might be an exception for power stats? I think some double in cost for dots 6-10.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not in any published books that I recall. The upper half of the ladder tends to be disincentivized by more onerous drawbacks and/or limited freebies rather than heightened Experience costs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T08:22:50-07:00","id":1480291,"title":"","content":"It is possible I'm just getting confused between CofD and Trinity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T09:41:22-07:00","id":1480295,"title":"","content":"5 XP.<br /> <br /> Your other friends are talking about 1E.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-06T11:26:04-07:00","id":1480300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1480281-how-many-experience-a-level-5-fightingstyle-merit-cost-in-cofd-2e\uff1f?p=1480286#post1480286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What your new friends described was true in CofD 1e (also known as nWoD).</div> </div> </div> </div>To be tediously accurate, the friend is applying 1e's escalating cost rule to 2e's base experience costs. In 1e each Merit dot would cost 2\u00d7(new rating) xp (with 1xp being more comparable to one beat in 2e than one experience), so a five-dot Merit would cost 2+4+6+8+10 = 30xp. This was the rule for any Merit, Fighting Style or not, and other traits had similarly escalating costs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-07T02:30:10-07:00","id":1480356,"title":"","content":"As someone who considers tedious accuracy something to aspire to, I bow my head before your and TwoDSix' excellence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-07T13:41:34-07:00","id":1480400,"title":"","content":"Well, for the sake of even more tedious accuracy: Some of the confusion around Merit costs in 1e was because the MET books for 1e used a different system from the TT Books. As noted, in the 1e TT rules, a 5-dot Merit costs 30 XP. It does matter if it's one thing that's rated 5, or a Style Merit that has a new function at each level. In the MET books, you only paid for each rating that added to the Merit. So a Merit that was a single 4 rating cost 8 XP, Alternate ID at 4 (1, 2, and 4) costed 14 XP, Striking Looks 4 (2 and 4) costed 12 XP, while Resources 4 or a Fighting Style at 4 would cost 20 XP.<br /> <br /> Back in the day there was a lot of debate about whether the MET books were meant to errata the TT books... despite the MET book developer saying they were different on purpose (mostly the MET liked it better that way), but it was pretty clear there were people that were probably unknowingly house ruling the TT rules into something more complicated than they've always been by using the MET XP rules, which means this confusion lasted into 2e.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}